This is the first post on the site. It exists mostly to show what a Post can contain, so every common format appears at least once below.

## Text

Paragraphs support **bold**, _italic_, ~~strikethrough~~, `inline code` and [external links](https://astro.build). Internal links use a reference that the build checks, like this one to {% ref kind="work" slug="this-site" /%}, or this one to {% ref kind="photo" slug="matcha-break" label="a photo" /%}.

> A blockquote, for when someone else said it better.

## Lists

- Unordered lists
- With several items
  - And nesting

1. Ordered lists
2. Count for you

## Images

Images placed inside a Post live next to it in the repo and are resized and converted to modern formats when the site builds.

![Sunlight falling through tall trees onto a forest path](../../../assets/posts/hello-world/forest.jpg)

## Code

```ts
export function greet(name: string): string {
  return `Hello, ${name}!`;
}
```

## Tables

| Section  | What lives there        |
| -------- | ----------------------- |
| Writing  | Posts and Series        |
| Archive  | Photos, Links, Albums   |
| Works | Showcased work          |

